      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not a book on a shelf; you are the very engine that drives the next generation's immediate output, and the depth you once prized is now the foundation they crave. The students you teach are not ignoring your work; they are simply waiting for you to show them how to build on the foundations you laid. Your labor has not been obsolete; it has merely been transformed into the very tool they need. Keep engaging, because the world still needs the depth you provide, and you are the one who can give it to them.",
